_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","review_id":"Mr_7ZXUE6zD2tG0IT31QFg","date":"2013-10-05T05:22:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9192523956298828,"text_excerpt":"Surprised to find hardly anyone in the dining room, even though our reso was for 9p. The food was good.....warm sliced bread and butter, for a starter---fried green tomatoes with crabmeat. Wedge salad was also fresh and tasty. For an entree we both had the Veal. A little too heavy on the sauce for me. The veal, although not the most tender, was panned and served atop yummy grits. All in all a good experience. Apparently they do a lot of business with out of town guests/conventions staying in the nearby hotels."},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","review_id":"aEf7qnopwWqo_KYjK0Kc-A","date":"2013-06-03T17:30:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9130016565322876,"text_excerpt":"I had read good things about this restaurant written by a local food critic whom I trust, but I was initially wary due to it being in a Wyndham hotel that serves the convention center. Those fears were reinforced when we arrived at 7:45 pm on a Saturday to find the dining room with less than 20 other customers. However, my concerns were unfounded. The room is nicely appointed in a clean, modern style. The staff were professional, friendly and eager to see we enjoyed ourselves. The food was very, very good with prices that are a bargain for a dining experience of this quality. The total bill before tip for - shared salad, 2 entrees, shared dessert and bottle of wine - was only $102 - witho..."},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","review_id":"gJ_HWVD2dHvgSAuIMAoWuA","date":"2008-01-23T22:18:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8978261351585388,"text_excerpt":"The conference arranged lunch for us at this restaurant....it was closed for general business to accommodate us. We started with a cup of gumbo....perfect roux and spices. The field green salad with a ball of fried goat cheese was pretty much the best salad I've had in a long time. The fried goat cheese was divine We all got the smothered chicken with mashed potatoes for an entree. I usually do not like smothered chicken but this was delicious. The deep fried chicken breasts were tender and covered with the right amount of gravy. For dessert, we were served pecan pie with rum in it. It was pretty much the best pecan pie I've ever had. The restaurant is located inside the Wyndham riverfron..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","photo_id":"2gIpZ6BJRbMQe0SD1PRfSw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2gIpZ6BJRbMQe0SD1PRfSw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8886752724647522},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","photo_id":"sVhFNk5x0QEUlz12y1B5jg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sVhFNk5x0QEUlz12y1B5jg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8636103272438049},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","photo_id":"tcjNwt3MX6rbo36eUsu3Uw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tcjNwt3MX6rbo36eUsu3Uw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8511521816253662},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","photo_id":"WJU1qSBW86xa2GfhcHO9qw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/WJU1qSBW86xa2GfhcHO9qw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8369667530059814},{"business_id":"VOaWZhnatGDLl1PBrXKTjg","photo_id":"6kFYua88c4CMovlCHqKTKw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/6kFYua88c4CMovlCHqKTKw.jpg","visual_r